            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke kumelwe nisuse la mazwi ami enhliziyweni yenu nasemphefumulweni wenu niwabophe njengophawu esandleni senu, ukuze abe njengezibopho phakathi kwamehlo enu.",
