              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonke indawo lapho amathe ezinyawo zenu eyakunyathela khona iyakuba ngeyenu, kusukela ehlane naseLebanoni, kusukela emfuleni, umfula u-Ewufrathe kuze kube selwandle lwasekugcineni kuyakuba ngumkhawulo wenu.",
