              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyakuthi lapho uJehova uNkulunkulu wakho esekungenise ezweni oya kulo ukulidla, ubeke isibusiso entabeni yaseGerizimu nesiqalekiso entabeni yase-Ebali.",
